MARKDOWN.append((
    '### 2D. Representation Note\n'
    '\n'
    '`Morgan`, `ECFP6`, and `FCFP6` are all circular fingerprints:\n'
    '\n'
    '- **Morgan** uses the user-selected radius and bit length\n'
    '- **ECFP6** uses atom-identity style invariants\n'
    '- **FCFP6** uses feature-based invariants\n'
    '- **Layered fingerprint** captures layered path/subgraph pattern classes\n'
    '- **Atom-pair** fingerprints encode atom-type pairs with topological distances\n'
    '- **Topological torsion** fingerprints encode 4-atom bond paths\n'
    '- **RDKit path** fingerprints capture hashed subgraph path patterns\n'
    '- **MACCS** provides a compact fixed key set\n'
    '- **RDKit descriptors** provide continuous physicochemical summary features\n'
    '\n'
    'If the descriptor count becomes large relative to the number of molecules, configure the optional **train-only feature-selection** step in `4A.5` (placed just before `4B`). The selector is fit in `4B` after the train/test split so held-out test rows do not influence the selected feature set.\n'
))

MARKDOWN.append((
    '## 3. Chemical Similarity Map\n'
    '\n'
    'Molecules that cluster together in this plot usually have more similar molecular feature profiles.\n'
))

MARKDOWN.append((
    '### Before You Run: 3A. Similarity Map\n'
    '\n'
    '**What this does.** Projects molecular features into a 2D map so you can see clusters, outliers, and chemical diversity.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Main choices.** Fewer points and simpler embedding settings are faster. Use this as a diagnostic, not as a measure of model accuracy.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Time cost.** Roughly 30 seconds to 8 minutes; t-SNE gets slower as molecule count grows.\n'
    '\n'
    '**What to expect.** An interactive plot colored by target values or classes.\n'
    '\n'
    '#### Why these defaults?\n'
    '\n'
    '| Option | Default | Benchmark | Status | Why |\n'
    '| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_morgan_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only; it does not feed any model. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_rdkit_descriptors` | on |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. Descriptors plus ECFP6 give a map that mixes shape and substructure. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_ecfp6_features` | on |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_fcfp6_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_layered_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_atom_pair_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_topological_torsion_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_rdk_path_features` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_maccs_keys` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_use_all_descriptors` | off |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_morgan_radius` | `2` |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `tsne_fingerprint_bits` | `1024` |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. |\n'
    '| `perplexity` | `30` |  | **No effect** | Visual map only. 30 is the scikit-learn default. |\n'
    '| `max_points_for_map` | `1000` |  | **No effect** | Visual map only; caps runtime on large sets. |\n'
    '| `embedding_random_seed` | `42` |  | **No effect** | Seed. |\n'
    '| `enable_similarity_map_cache` | on |  | **No effect** | Caching only. |\n'
    '| `reuse_similarity_map_cache` | on |  | **No effect** | Caching only. |\n'
    '| `similarity_map_cache_run_name` | `AUTO` |  | **No effect** | Cache name. |\n'
))

