MARKDOWN.append((
    '### Before You Run: 4B. Run Feature Selection\n'
    '\n'
    '**What this does.** Applies the selected feature-reduction strategy to the training data and carries the same selected columns to the test data.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Main choices.** Use caching for reruns. If ElasticNetCV times out, let the random-forest fallback complete rather than repeatedly trying the same slow selector.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Time cost.** Seconds for small datasets, often 5-20 minutes for larger feature matrices. The ElasticNetCV estimate scales with training-row count and feature count.\n'
    '\n'
    '**What to expect.** Selected feature counts, any timeout/fallback note, and prepared train/test matrices for modeling.\n'
))

