    '            "Your local `tabpfn` backend requires a newer PyTorch build that includes torch.nn.RMSNorm. "\n'
    '            "Prefer `tabpfn_client` (API backend) or upgrade PyTorch in this environment."\n'
    '        )\n'
    '    if ("version" in message and "too old" in message) or "client version" in message:\n'
