MARKDOWN.append((
    '### Before You Run: 5B. Deep-Learning Models\n'
    '\n'
    '**What this does.** Optionally fits ChemML MLPs, TabPFN, and MapLight + GNN when available.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Main choices.** Start with ChemML PyTorch only. Turn on TabPFN only after access passes. MapLight + GNN is mainly for local compatible environments because Colab DGL/PyTorch compatibility is fragile.\n'
    '\n'
    '**Time cost.** About 5-60+ minutes. GPU helps; CPU-only deep learning can be slow. Larger datasets and more epochs increase time.\n'
    '\n'
    '**What to expect.** Additional model rows or clear skip messages for unavailable backends.\n'
    '\n'
    '#### Why these defaults?\n'
    '\n'
    '| Option | Default | Benchmark | Status | Why |\n'
    '| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n'
    "| `run_chemml_pytorch` | on | on | **Benchmark** | Included as the tutorial's simple neural network (about 40 s). ChemML MLPs were the weakest family in the benchmark (median gap 20.7% regression, 12.4% classification). |\n"
    '| `run_chemml_tensorflow` | off | on | **Lighter** | Off to save time. It was the better ChemML backend for classification (7.5% vs 12.4%); consider it there. |\n'
    '| `run_maplight_gnn` | off | on | **Lighter** | Off because DGL often fails to install in Colab. When it runs it is strong for regression (4 wins, median gap 8.0%) but weak for classification (11.5%); about 137 s per dataset. |\n'
    '| `run_tabpfn_deep` | off | off (A100); on (later run) | **Lighter** | Off because it needs a Prior Labs API key. Where it ran, TabPFN was the second-best single regression model (6 wins, median gap 5.2%); 7.3% classification. Worth enabling for regression. |\n'
    '| `run_tabpfn_local` | off |  | **Untested** | Runs TabPFN locally instead of through the API; needs the model weights and ideally a GPU. |\n'
    '| `tabpfn_max_train_rows` | `1000` | 1000 | **Benchmark** | As in the canonical run; the later run used 11,000. Larger sets are subsampled to this size. |\n'
    '| `chemml_hidden_layers` | `2` | 2 | **Benchmark** | As in the benchmark. |\n'
    '| `chemml_hidden_width` | `128` | 256 | **Lighter** | Half the benchmark width, for CPU runtimes. |\n'
    "| `chemml_training_epochs` | `60` | 80 | **Lighter** | Fewer than the benchmark's 80, for CPU runtimes. |\n"
    '| `chemml_batch_size` | `64` | 64 | **Benchmark** | As in the benchmark. |\n'
    '| `chemml_learning_rate` | `0.001` | 0.001 | **Benchmark** | As in the benchmark. |\n'
    '| `chemml_use_cross_validation` | on | on | **Benchmark** | As in the benchmark. |\n'
    '| `chemml_cv_folds` | `5` | 5 | **Benchmark** | As in the benchmark. |\n'
    '| `deep_random_seed` | `42` |  | **No effect** | Seed. |\n'
    '| `enable_deep_model_cache` | on |  | **No effect** | Caching only. |\n'
    '| `reuse_deep_cached_models` | on |  | **No effect** | Caching only. |\n'
    '| `deep_cache_run_name` | `AUTO` |  | **No effect** | Cache name. |\n'
))

